<title>SINGAPORE: ST Electronic secures $7.5 mln contract.</title>
<headline>ST Electronic secures $7.5 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>ST Electronic &amp; Engineering Ltd, part of the Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp, said on Wednesday it had won a US$7.5 million contract to supply and implement a building management system for a building in Shanghai, China.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
